  "note": "As printed (12.34) fails at p₀ = 3, q = 3, since log 3/3 > log 2/2; it holds for p₀ ≥ 5, covering the book's use. Erratum: (12.34) is printed for every prime p0, but at q = p0 = 3 it says log 3/3 <= log 2/2, which is false (kappa(3) = 0.30038 < 0.30769 at rho = 0.6, and for every rho). (checked by `scripts/checks/eq_12_34.py`)."
